Vapntreyiu is [[armor]]ed [[Cloak]] that gives defensive stats, but can be worn underneath defensive armor (like [[Leather Armor]] or [[Bronze Plate]]), in both the shirt and cloak slots, allowing two to be worn at once.

It is an essential part of any serious warrior's gear.

==Quality==

The quality formula is <math>\frac{_{q}Cloth + _{q}Wool +_{q}String}{3}</math> [[softcap]]ped by <math>\sqrt{Sewing*Dexterity}</math>

