==Reference==

In medieval Norse, ''Vapntreyiu'' literally means "arming shirt". It is a padded, quilted jacket stuffed with wool or similar, often worn underneath armor for additional protection. It is also known as a [//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gambeson gambeson] or aketon.

